        "text": "d1.2-ultra is the #1 model on the Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1, with d1.2 placing #6\n\n@liquidai has released d1.2-ultra and d1.2, updating their d1-ultra and d1.1 flagship decision models.\n\nKey results:\n\n➤ d1.2-ultra is the #1 model on AA-Paperclip. With a score of 76, d1.2-ultra is the leading model on AA-Paperclip, our first-party private benchmark that assesses decision-making and extraction capabilities. It leads the next-best model, Drex Max v1.1, by 3 points\n\n➤ d1.2-ultra and d1.2 improve over their predecessors. d1.2-ultra scores 75, a 4-point gain over its predecessor d1-ultra, while d1.2 scores 69, a 3-point improvement over d1.1\n\n➤ d1.2-ultra and d1.2 both sit on the Capability vs. Cost Pareto frontier. d1.2-ultra and d1.2 cost $133 and $63, respectively, per one million Artificial Analysis Decision Index tasks and both models sit on the Capability vs. Cost Pareto frontier\n\nAdditional model details:\n\n➤ Context window: 64K tokens\n\n➤ Pricing: $0.042 and $0.02 per 1M input tokens for d1.2-ultra and d1.2, respectively\n\n➤ Multimodality: Text and image input\n\n➤ Providers: Available through Liquid AI’s first-party API"
