        "text": "All this AI progress before GTA VI!\n\nSince the first GTA VI trailer in December 2023, the top score on the Artificial Analysis Progress Index has more than doubled, from 160 to 358:\n\n➤ 481 of the 491 models on the Index were released\n\n➤ The top score was beaten on 23 separate days, by models from @OpenAI, @GoogleDeepMind, @spacexai and @AnthropicAI\n\n➤ GPT-4 Turbo held the top score on trailer day and would now rank 379th\n\n➤ 7 of those 23 came after the revised launch date of May 26\n\nGTA VI launches November 19. To the AI labs, please no launches that day, the team seems to be coming down with something."
